handle, and flush mounted retractable lifting handle.  Door must have a minimum load rating for[ AASHTO HS-20]<MET> [6,800 kg]</MET><ENG> [15,000 lbs]</ENG> load.[  
Center door[ over meter assembly][ over ladder and aligned with interior wall].]</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
]<SPT><TTL>Fittings</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Provide flanged fittings for pipe<MET> 75 mm</MET><ENG> 3 inches</ENG> and larger.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Vault Valves</TTL><BRK/>
<NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
<NPR>NOTE:  Use indicating type valves inside the vault (i.e., OS&amp;Y, ball, butterfly) so that the valve's position 
can be observed without entering the confined space.</NPR><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Provide[ ball][ outside screw and yoke (OS&amp;Y)][ butterfly] valves in meter vault.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
</SPT>][<SPT><TTL>Plastic Meter Boxes</TTL><BRK/>
<NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
<NPR>NOTE:  Plastic boxes and lids are acceptable for use in unpaved areas or grass areas not subject to vehicular 
traffic.</NPR><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<NPR>Medium duty ratings include occasional vehicle traffic such as a stray vehicle or tractor use for mowing.  Do 
not use medium duty ratings in areas where vehicle traffic is expected.</NPR><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Provide manufactured plastic boxes[ and lids] meeting the following requirements:</TXT><BRK/>
<OLG><BRK/>
